{"hymn":"S341","parent":"E443","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Completa es mi entrega","subtitle":"Consagración—Rendirlo todo al Señor","syl":{"n1":["Com","i"],"n3":["ple","m"],"n4":["ta","t"],"n5":"es","n6":["mi‿en","i"],"n7":["tre","m"],"n8":["ga,","t"],"n9":"A","n11":"Ti","n12":"me","n13":["rin","i"],"n14":["do","t"],"n15":"hoy;","n17":"Por","n18":["siem","i"],"n19":["pre‿y","t"],"n20":"por","n21":["com","i"],"n22":["ple","m"],"n23":["to,","t"],"n24":"Soy","n25":["Tu","i"],"n26":["yo,","t"],"n28":"mi","n29":["Se","i"],"n30":["ñor.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Hijo de Dios, me‿amaste,","Y Tuyo yo seré;","¡Lo que yo soy y tengo,","Por siempre Tuyo es!"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Señor Jesús, hoy reina","Sobre mi corazón,","Pues siempre será Tuyo,","Amado Salvador."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["¡Oh, ven y reina, Cristo,","Gobierna todo hoy!","Hazme leal, Rey mío","Y fiel a Ti, Señor"]}]}